  "title": "Qt: fix DIS stream analysis build without QtMultimedia",
  "description": "This follow-up fixes the DIS Stream Analysis Qt build when QtMultimedia is not installed.\n\nThe original feature in !24116 left one unguarded audio_stream_ code path in ui/qt/dis_stream_analysis_dialog.cpp. This change keeps the common plot update path unconditional and guards the QtMultimedia-dependent logic with QT_MULTIMEDIA_LIB.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes [Codex]",
